<title>USA: MEMC Electronic Q4 shr net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>MEMC Electronic Q4 shr net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERS, Mo. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.14	   profit $0.75</p>
<p> Net    loss     5,709	   profit 30,852</p>
<p> Sales	     201,833		  262,382</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  41,436		   41,400</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $2.45	   profit $2.78</p>
<p> Net    profit   101,556	 profit 87,273</p>
<p> Sales	     1,119,500		886,860</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  41,420		   31,385</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is MEMC Electronic Materials Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said earnings for the year ended December 31, 1995 were proforma and calculated based on the weighted average number of shares outstanding plus for the three months ended March 31, 1995, the number shares that would have had to be sold at the IPO price to fund the excess of the $100 million dividend to Hls Corp in April 1995.</p>
